{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn7le15ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So Sally, did you recommend journalism to the person who contacted you?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, I did.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Could you tell me why journalism is a good career field in today's job market?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I've been thinking a lot about this question.  It's always a fast-paced environment. There is a lot of competition between newspapers, magazines and other websites. All of those sources require people to create content.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le15ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Can you explain how you manage to succeed so well in your field?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: From my experience, you need to have an eye for detail in order to make stories interesting. I have been learning a lot as a freelancer.", "id": 2, "time": "26500", "image": "engenn7le15ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: There is competition in many sectors, especially in creative jobs.  I have met some designers or architects who also say their fields are very competitive.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're right about that!  In my opinion, if you are perseverant, it's possible to make a good livelihood working in this area. Just like artists, new journalists definitely need to create a portfolio of their work. I also think it's very important to maintain good working relationships with your colleagues. Teamwork is crucial nowadays.", "id": 3, "time": "39750", "image": "engenn7le15ob05re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le15ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le15ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slide