r opinion on different career fields.  ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Sally and the Job Inquiry", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Today's Job Market", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 15, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Present Perfect Continuous vs. Present Perfect Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use these tenses  to express that an action began in the past and is still going on or has just finished. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect tense</span> mainly to express that an action is completed or to emphasize the result.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Forms:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Regular verbs: form of 'have' + base form of verb + ed", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I have worked at the bakery for six years.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/>Irregular verbs: form of 'have' + past participle of irregular verbs", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I have written a number of books in the last two years.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/>You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect Continuous tense</span> to emphasize the duration or continuous course of an action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Form:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Form of 'have' + been + base form of verb + ing", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">We have been walking for two hours!</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " I have been thinking a lot about this question. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I have been learning a lot as a freelancer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I have met some designers or architects who also complain about competition in their fields.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Questions Within Sentences", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "We often ask for clarification when we are not clear on what the other person is referring to. We ask the other person to be more specific by giving more information. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use questions within sentences to ask for clarification. You ask a question including a sentence within the question, like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense</span>?<br/>Questions within sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification.<br/>Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make <span class=\"strong\"> embedded questions</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Main Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Embedded Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you know ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you help me understand ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you explain ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you tell me ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Could you tell me why journalism is a good career field in today's job market?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Can you explain how you manage to succeed so well in your field?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fast-paced", "type": "name"}, {"content": "many things happening quickly or at the same time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's always a fast-paced environment. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about different career fields.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to have an eye for detail", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be able to notice or observe", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need to have an eye for interesting details.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "competition", "type": "name"}, {"content": "two or more people or groups trying to get the same thing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is competition in many sectors, especially in creative jobs.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to succeed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do very well", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you explain how you manage to succeed?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sector", "type": "name"}, {"content": "part, area, division (of work, of a town, etc.)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a lot of competition in many sectors.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "today's job market", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the possibility of getting a job at the present time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Could you tell me why journalism is a good career field in today's job market?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "livelihood", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way a person makes money to live", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you are perseverant, it's possible to make a good livelihood working in this area. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "portfolio", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a collection of documents (images, texts, etc.) a person uses to show the quality of their work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Just like artists, new journalists definitely need to create a portfolio of their work. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le15ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, think of 10 adjectives that could describe occupations or careers. For example, you could use the words <span class=\"italic\">fast-paced</span>, <span class=\"italic\">competitive</span>, <span class=\"italic\">calm</span> ...", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online. Find 10 new occupations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss the occupations. For each one, describe the occupation using 2 - 3 of your adjectives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain why you described the occupation this way.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose the top 3 occupations you would like to have.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify occupations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe occupations using adjectives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give my opinion on occupations and careers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain why I choose 3 occupations.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}